  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening DIMAS institutional capacity and service delivery for Migrant registration and documentation in Aruba</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed 6-month intervention aims to address critical operational bottlenecks at the DIMAS helpdesk by providing direct, hands-on support to migrants navigating the permit and documentation process. This includes resolving delayed permits, correcting erroneous negative decisions, receiving and processing missing documentation for pending applications, providing real-time status updates on petitions, and guiding walk-in applicants on required documentation</narrative>
  </description>
